OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fevening and night, a light shower
OL,7,Fpossible along the north coast. Often
OL,8,Fcloudy in the north east but clearer
OL,9,Fskies in the west will lead to a
OL,10,Fslight frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FLargely dry with variable
OL,13,Famounts of cloud, best of the sunshine
OL,14,Facross the west. Chance of a light
OL,15,Fshower along North Sea coasts. Light
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
